      "lines": [
        "2. 在谐振动的情况下，按照微分方程",
        "$y''(t)=-\\omega^2y(t)$，　(14)",
        "一般解具有下面的形式：",
        "$y(t)=A\\cos(\\omega t+\\varphi)$，　(15)",
        "其中$A$和$\\varphi$是任意常数。如果给出初始条件",
        "$y(0)=y_0$，$y'(0)=v_0$，",
        "这两个常数就可以确定。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "这些例子使我们能够理解微分方程是多么强有力的研究",
        "工具。通常，控制任何一个过程的基本规律都可以写成微分",
        "方程的形式，而为了要弄清楚所进行的是怎样的过程，就必须",
        "解这些微分方程。 $\\blacktriangleleft$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "exhead",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "习题"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "624",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "624. 证明：函数$y=5e^{3x}$满足方程$y'=3y$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "625",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "625. 证明：函数$y=7e^{-2x}$满足方程$y'=-2y$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "626",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "626. 证明：函数$y=3e^{-7x}$满足方程$y'=-7y$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "627",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "627. * $m$毫克镭$C$经放射衰变$t$分钟后，剩下$n$毫克。求镭",
        "$C$的半衰期，也就是说，经过几分钟后剩下$0.5m$毫克",
        "镭$C$？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "628",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "628. * 设放射衰变开始时，有$1$克镭$A$，如果它的半衰期等于",
        "$3$分钟，经过几分钟后，它剩下$0.125$克？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "629",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "629. * 设放射性物质的半衰期等于$1$小时。经过几小时后，",
        "它的量减少十分之九？"
      ]
    },
